{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-btitle",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1400,
   "y": -760,
   "width": 1300,
   "height": 210,
   "text": "# Qwen3.8-Flash-Next — one decoder layer  \nThe residual stream is **4 lanes** ([T, 4×2560]). A gated residual **reads** one 2560-wide input from it, the token mixer runs — **either** Gated DeltaNet (left, 36 layers) **or** QSA attention (right, 12 layers) — and its output is **written** back to every lane. The same again for the MoE. Bars ∝ channels (0.06 px/channel). Shapes per token."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-bsrc",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 100,
   "y": -760,
   "width": 1300,
   "height": 210,
   "text": "Traced from transformers `modular_qwen4_exp.py` (Qwen4ExpTextDecoderLayer, Qwen4ExpTextGatedResidual, Qwen4ExpTextQSAIndexer, Qwen4ExpTextPLELayer; GatedDeltaNet / attention / MoE inherited from Qwen3.5 and Qwen3-Next) and checked against the checkpoint's tensor names/shapes. Parameter counts are per layer. All weights BF16."
  },
  {
   "id": "t1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -307,
   "y": -480,
   "width": 614,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 327,
   "y": -490,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`H [T, 4×2560]  residual lanes in`"
  },
  {
   "id": "op3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -160,
   "y": -426,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 72,
   "text": "**+ PLE** n-gram injection  \n(L1 only; identity elsewhere)",
   "color": "#d946ef"
  },
  {
   "id": "t4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -307,
   "y": -314,
   "width": 614,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 327,
   "y": -324,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`H [T, 10240]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "op6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -160,
   "y": -260,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 130,
   "text": "**attn_hyper_connection** read  \nRMSNorm per lane → gate = σ(up(SiLU(down Ĥ / 4)))  \ndown 10240→320, up 320→10240 · x = mean over lanes of gate ⊙ Ĥ  \n6.6M · incl. inject",
   "color": "#eab308"
  },
  {
   "id": "inj7",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -690,
   "y": -240,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**block_inject_weight** Ĥ 10240→4  \nw = 2·σ(· / 4)  · [T, 4]",
   "color": "#eab308"
  },
  {
   "id": "t8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -77,
   "y": -90,
   "width": 154,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 180,
   "y": -100,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`x [T, 2560]  block input`"
  },
  {
   "id": "op10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1220,
   "y": -6,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "**in_proj_qkv** 2560 → 10240  \n26.2M",
   "color": "#22d3ee"
  },
  {
   "id": "t11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1367,
   "y": 98,
   "width": 614,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1947,
   "y": 88,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`[T, 10240] = q 2048 · k 2048 · v 6144`"
  },
  {
   "id": "op13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1220,
   "y": 152,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "**causal conv1d** (k=4, per channel) + SiLU",
   "color": "#22d3ee"
  },
  {
   "id": "t14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1367,
   "y": 256,
   "width": 614,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1947,
   "y": 246,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`q,k [T, 16, 128] · v [T, 48, 128]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "op16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1220,
   "y": 310,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "**L2-norm q, k**; repeat 16 → 48 heads",
   "color": "#22d3ee"
  },
  {
   "id": "t17",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1420,
   "y": 414,
   "width": 720,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl18",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -2000,
   "y": 404,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`q,k,v [T, 48, 128]` — bar clipped (real 1106px)"
  },
  {
   "id": "op19",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1220,
   "y": 468,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 96,
   "text": "**gated delta rule**  \nS ← α·S(I − β k kᵀ) + β v kᵀ,  o = S q  \nstate S [48, 128, 128] per layer",
   "color": "#22d3ee"
  },
  {
   "id": "t20",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1244,
   "y": 604,
   "width": 369,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl21",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1824,
   "y": 594,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`o [T, 48, 128]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "op22",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1220,
   "y": 658,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "**gated RMSNorm** per head  \nnorm(o) · **sigmoid**(z)",
   "color": "#22d3ee"
  },
  {
   "id": "t23",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1244,
   "y": 762,
   "width": 369,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl24",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1824,
   "y": 752,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`[T, 6144]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "op25",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1220,
   "y": 816,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "**out_proj** 6144 → 2560  \n15.7M",
   "color": "#22d3ee"
  },
  {
   "id": "t26",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1137,
   "y": 920,
   "width": 154,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl27",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1800,
   "y": 910,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`[T, 2560]  mixer out`"
  },
  {
   "id": "gdn-ab",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -330,
   "y": 468,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 110,
   "text": "**in_proj_a, in_proj_b** (from x)  \nα = exp(−e^A_log · softplus(a + dt_bias))  \nβ = sigmoid(b)  · [T, 48] each",
   "color": "#22d3ee"
  },
  {
   "id": "gdn-z",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -330,
   "y": 658,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "**in_proj_z** (from x) → z [T, 6144]",
   "color": "#22d3ee"
  },
  {
   "id": "op28",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 600,
   "y": -6,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "**q_proj** 2560 → 12288  \n31.5M",
   "color": "#f97316"
  },
  {
   "id": "t29",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 400,
   "y": 98,
   "width": 720,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl30",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -180,
   "y": 88,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`[T, 24, 256+256] = query | gate` — bar clipped (real 737px)"
  },
  {
   "id": "op31",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 600,
   "y": 152,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "**split**; RMSNorm on q (per head)",
   "color": "#f97316"
  },
  {
   "id": "t32",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 576,
   "y": 256,
   "width": 369,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl33",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 964,
   "y": 246,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`q [T, 24, 256]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "op34",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 600,
   "y": 310,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "**RoPE** on 64 of 256 dims  \n(M-RoPE t/h/w 11/11/10 pairs, θ=10 000 000)",
   "color": "#f97316"
  },
  {
   "id": "t35",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 576,
   "y": 430,
   "width": 369,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl36",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 964,
   "y": 420,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`q [T, 24, 256]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "op37",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 600,
   "y": 484,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 96,
   "text": "**sparse softmax attention**  \ncausal ∧ indexer-selected tokens only  \nGQA: 12 query heads per K/V head",
   "color": "#f97316"
  },
  {
   "id": "t38",
   "type": "text",
