   "y": 464,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 140,
   "text": "**k_proj, v_proj** (from x) 2560 → 2×256 each · 2.6M  \nRMSNorm + RoPE on k  \nKV cache: 1 024 values / token",
   "color": "#f97316"
  },
  {
   "id": "op46",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2240,
   "y": 254,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "**index_qk_proj** 2560 → (4+1)×128  \n1.6M",
   "color": "#f43f5e"
  },
  {
   "id": "t47",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2381,
   "y": 358,
   "width": 38,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl48",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2580,
   "y": 348,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`q_I [T, 4, 128] · k_I [T, 128] (cached)`"
  },
  {
   "id": "op49",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2240,
   "y": 412,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 96,
   "text": "**keys**: mean of each 4-token block → RMSNorm → RoPE at block start  \n**queries**: RMSNorm → RoPE",
   "color": "#f43f5e"
  },
  {
   "id": "t50",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2381,
   "y": 548,
   "width": 38,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl51",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2580,
   "y": 538,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`q_I [T, 4, 128] · block keys [T/4, 128]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "op52",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2240,
   "y": 602,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "**score** = Σ_h ReLU(q_I,h · k_blk) / √128",
   "color": "#f43f5e"
  },
  {
   "id": "t53",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2360,
   "y": 706,
   "width": 80,
   "height": 9,
